RATE CALORIE BURNING PLUS 400MG GREEN COFFEE*\n+ ANABOLIC RAW POWER WITH 5G BETAINE TO DRIVE DOMINANT WORKOUTS PLUS 2G LEUCINE & 2000MCG DIM*\n+ TARGETS 9 PRIMAL PHYSIOGENIC FACTORS CRUCIAL FOR HARDCORE MUSCLE RESULTS*"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"PHYSIOBOLIC EDGE"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"BANNED SUBSTANCE FREE*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"NATURAL FLAVOR"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 791304 LOG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, add one scoop with 6-8 fl. oz. of cold water daily. For maximum results, take two servings 30-60 minutes pre-workout. Do not take prior to bedtime."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"WARNING: For adult use only."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Do not use this product if you are pregnant or lactating. Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"^In a double-blind, randomized, placebo-controlled, cross-over study, 25 subjects exercised on a treadmill on two occasions. On one occasion the subjects took the thermogenic blend before exercise and on the second occasion, they took a placebo. When the subjects took the thermogenic blend, they burned three time more calories before, 3% more calories during and 12 times more calories after exercise compared to when they took the placebo."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"GNC BEYOND RAW(R) RE-PUMP(TM) - the first anabolic thermogenic of its kind to combine clinically studied, muscle-fueling ingredients with advanced physique support that works to enhance performance and metabolism before-during-after hardcore training.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"This scientifically designed, expert-formulated muscle fuel also leverages a new supplementation methodology in sports nutrition, the Physiobolic Edge. This new system is based off the latest research that targets the following 9 Primal Physiogenic Factors crucial to support a shredded physique and anabolic building power.\n- Anabolic Hormones\n- Anabolic Primers\n- N.O. Pumps\n- Carbohydrate Metabolism\n- Muscle Cell Energy\n- Increased Calorie Burning\n- Fat Metabolism\n- Water Regulation\n- Muscle Cell Protection & Recovery*\nAs you push to take shredded and pumped to the next level in your cutting phase, utilize this enhancing compound packed with ingredients to fuel intense N.O. Pumps and thermogenics clinically proven to Increase Calorie Burning up to 12X.^*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The HYPER-VASCULAR MATRIX contains glycerol and agmatine, plus resveratrol and citrulline to fuel training that drives insane roadmap vascularity. The THERMO-METABOLIC ACTIVATOR features green coffee along with carnitine to facilitate Fat Metabolism and CLA, clinically shown to improve physique and body composition.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The muscle-building ANABOLIC DENSITY COMPOUND includes efficacious doses of clinically validated Anabolic Primers: betaine to provide you with punishing strength and explosive power, along with leucine to fuel muscle protein synthesis.* This muscle-shredding ignitor also delivers the ultimate Muscle Cell Protection & Recovery with ROS (Reactive Oxygen Species) cell defense and key nutrients to help support recovery after your most hardcore training session.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This creatine-free, anabolic thermogenic pre-workout also features targeted metabolic power with Opuntia, a prickly pear extract, to support extreme anabolic activity by activating insulin, the Anabolic Hormone critical for Carbohydrate Metabolism and rapid nutrient uptake.* Plus, it's loaded with key electrolytes to facilitate Water Regulation and fuel Muscle Cell Energy on the molecular level.* Prepare yourself. Experience the different."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Go beyond pumped - get BEYOND RAW(R)."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"PHYSIOBOLIC EDGE"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"The Physiobolic Edge is the advanced, performance-based technology powering the science behind GNC BEYOND RAW(R) with more than best-in-class, cutting-edge ingredients. This new, research-based system advances molecular functions not yet targeted by other products by synchronizing with vital physiological mechanisms and genetic pathways before, during and after extreme workouts that unleash your maximum muscle-mind-body potential. This powerful addition gives hardcore sports nutrition a new meaning: physiogenic performance fuel as you push for a physique like never before, muscle-maximizing size, explosive strength and power.* The Physiobolic Edge targets the exact 10 Primal Physiogenic Factors that open the door to extreme results."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 13921 6","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}